  "title": "Detroit-Style Coney Dogs",
  "description": "Fire up the grill and put together baseball-style hot dogs inspired by the classic Detroit Coney. Topped by onions, warmed chile sauce, and mustard, every meaty bite will take you out to the ballgame.",
