  "ingredients": [
    "4 hot dogs with natural casings",
    "1 hot dog rolls, sliced",
    "1 small onion, diced",
    "1 (10 ounce) can chile sauce without beans",
    "4 tablespoons prepared yellow mustard, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pfxyYZdaFgsN_cpsC2zM7avIu40=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141138-detroit-style-coney-dogs-VAT-005-step-01-638310c512fc499da33bc3d8e33b0ce7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141138/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place hot dogs on the grill; cook until browned, 5 to 8 minutes, turning once, or until done to suit your taste. Lightly grill hot dog rolls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ma1uRB-n3-YAw2Qb1g2cxfZynH8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141138-detroit-style-coney-dogs-VAT-006-step-02-e8c8b2556da64efeb91e499306d27cd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141138/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place the chile sauce in a small microwave-safe bowl; cook 1 minute. Stir, and cook 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FvSQTFVPOCK5VLbapLzbnMFUeTk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141138-detroit-style-coney-dogs-VAT-007-step-03-16b0c9ae98e04cf4b2fec70c0a7c57bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141138/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place hot dogs on buns. Top each with chile sauce, onion, and 1 tablespoon mustard, or to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
